{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_9774c2cd67c14057b395dca4456c479b","id":"pg_1b934221e1c65c0da0a75b68d1fc985d","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/aider-ai-aider-requirements-txt-5dc9490bb35f-5b68d1fc985d.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_169626a83eeb5c2d858752926524ae3e"],"title":"Aider-AI/aider/requirements.txt @ 5dc9490bb35f","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9774c2cd67c14057b395dca4456c479b"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_131cd072eefb6531c8a7fa73ea71d89e27afb8fa1db278358505e460549ee56a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Aider integrates with git, automatically committing changes with generated commit messages so users can diff, manage and undo AI edits with normal git tools."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8b82a09e4e018106e3a4669f45a48ac1782f2f47ab0ae029df06319b6299ad91"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Aider connects to a wide range of LLM providers (Anthropic, OpenAI, DeepSeek, Gemini, OpenRouter, Bedrock, Vertex AI, Ollama, xAI) and works with most popular programming languages."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9023d5a1e58b9cae3e007214a6d8ffc8fc9f258bd542abdbec892a58c78320c0"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The CLI accepts --model and --api-key flags, e.g. aider --model deepseek --api-key deepseek=<key>, and models can be selected via short aliases like sonnet or o3-mini."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c527cd885acece952ead5836dcc5051135f126b3c9a9e85f92015429de1d6baf"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Aider builds a map of the entire codebase (repo map) to work well in larger projects, with tree-sitter based support for many languages including Fortran, Haskell, Julia, Zig, Kotlin, Scala, OCaml, Dart and MATLAB."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d1cc5dadf9eb1d6e5dffebd7572c3d6e16b487a6f3aaf1961c60b243e2550b03"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project maintains a public code-editing leaderboard; release notes cite model scores on it (e.g. Claude 3.5 Haiku at 75%) and benchmark statistics include token counts."},{"claim_ids":["clm_db369e10891cc1804f16eabb655f543d6c0f68789c639ecca92ea63a26f48b2c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A watch-files mode lets users add AI-prefixed comments in any file from their IDE or editor to trigger aider, and a --copy-paste mode streamlines working with LLM web chat UIs."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e154632775f096e2ac5c66041bccac217a2b4215f09372ff4ef6121147812bfe"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Aider is a terminal application for AI pair programming with LLMs, usable to start new projects or work on existing codebases."}],"claim_ids":["clm_131cd072eefb6531c8a7fa73ea71d89e27afb8fa1db278358505e460549ee56a","clm_8b82a09e4e018106e3a4669f45a48ac1782f2f47ab0ae029df06319b6299ad91","clm_9023d5a1e58b9cae3e007214a6d8ffc8fc9f258bd542abdbec892a58c78320c0","clm_c527cd885acece952ead5836dcc5051135f126b3c9a9e85f92015429de1d6baf","clm_d1cc5dadf9eb1d6e5dffebd7572c3d6e16b487a6f3aaf1961c60b243e2550b03","clm_db369e10891cc1804f16eabb655f543d6c0f68789c639ecca92ea63a26f48b2c","clm_e154632775f096e2ac5c66041bccac217a2b4215f09372ff4ef6121147812bfe"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_9774c2cd67c14057b395dca4456c479b","id":"pg_2c2e8cbe9d7e502f85a4ebc7c45d1af2","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/aider-ai-aider-readme-md-5dc9490bb35f-ebc7c45d1af2.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_7562df515f4d511eb665058fdc0a6c99"],"title":"Aider-AI/aider/README.md @ 5dc9490bb35f","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9774c2cd67c14057b395dca4456c479b"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_9774c2cd67c14057b395dca4456c479b","id":"pg_3ca6da80acd354a59bb925b6efed1bce","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/aider-ai-aider-contributing-md-5dc9490bb35f-25b6efed1bce.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_5593d6f6dc215445a571621ebc19745d"],"title":"Aider-AI/aider/CONTRIBUTING.md @ 5dc9490bb35f","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9774c2cd67c14057b395dca4456c479b"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_03a7158d89e6bacf74bd5b958629670b055c8180ab8496acbc559e9706606918"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Aider supports multiple edit formats per model family, including diff, udiff-simple, patch, editor-diff, editor-whole and editor-diff-fenced, and can auto-select the best format in architect mode."},{"claim_ids":["clm_78145070fba69f2d173d5a216dca54c3329b9c27dd660f8d03730ea3b7613bd9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Model-specific behaviors are configurable: thinking-tokens and reasoning-effort settings, temperature disabling for GPT-5 models, and per-model weak/editor model defaults."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8b82a09e4e018106e3a4669f45a48ac1782f2f47ab0ae029df06319b6299ad91"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Aider connects to a wide range of LLM providers (Anthropic, OpenAI, DeepSeek, Gemini, OpenRouter, Bedrock, Vertex AI, Ollama, xAI) and works with most popular programming languages."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c527cd885acece952ead5836dcc5051135f126b3c9a9e85f92015429de1d6baf"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Aider builds a map of the entire codebase (repo map) to work well in larger projects, with tree-sitter based support for many languages including Fortran, Haskell, Julia, Zig, Kotlin, Scala, OCaml, Dart and MATLAB."},{"claim_ids":["clm_cbea6b719deefdd1e687304fd00b32e40375e52d034d5ad81e5605f34c067c49"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Aider depends on litellm for LLM connectivity; several releases bumped litellm (e.g. 1.75.0) to pick up provider fixes, and the deprecated google-generativeai dependency was removed."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d1cc5dadf9eb1d6e5dffebd7572c3d6e16b487a6f3aaf1961c60b243e2550b03"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project maintains a public code-editing leaderboard; release notes cite model scores on it (e.g. Claude 3.5 Haiku at 75%) and benchmark statistics include token counts."},{"claim_ids":["clm_db369e10891cc1804f16eabb655f543d6c0f68789c639ecca92ea63a26f48b2c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A watch-files mode lets users add AI-prefixed comments in any file from their IDE or editor to trigger aider, and a --copy-paste mode streamlines working with LLM web chat UIs."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ee21edf5f502abee4183d2bf0cbf5db3d7512f0ac7cea0c5745a43b7c443c4d1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: release notes state that Aider itself wrote a large share of each release's code (e.g. 88% in v0.86.0 and 92% in v0.82.0), indicating heavy dogfooding of the tool in its own development."},{"claim_ids":["clm_fb941bb5e91e20baa0148d463c45ba18af0ed02c88388be7e11fba5b5c186d21"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Aider provides slash commands such as /model, /undo, /clear, /run, /test, /diff, /editor, /copy-context, /save and /load for in-session control."}],"claim_ids":["clm_03a7158d89e6bacf74bd5b958629670b055c8180ab8496acbc559e9706606918","clm_78145070fba69f2d173d5a216dca54c3329b9c27dd660f8d03730ea3b7613bd9","clm_8b82a09e4e018106e3a4669f45a48ac1782f2f47ab0ae029df06319b6299ad91","clm_c527cd885acece952ead5836dcc5051135f126b3c9a9e85f92015429de1d6baf","clm_cbea6b719deefdd1e687304fd00b32e40375e52d034d5ad81e5605f34c067c49","clm_d1cc5dadf9eb1d6e5dffebd7572c3d6e16b487a6f3aaf1961c60b243e2550b03","clm_db369e10891cc1804f16eabb655f543d6c0f68789c639ecca92ea63a26f48b2c","clm_ee21edf5f502abee4183d2bf0cbf5db3d7512f0ac7cea0c5745a43b7c443c4d1","clm_fb941bb5e91e20baa0148d463c45ba18af0ed02c88388be7e11fba5b5c186d21"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_9774c2cd67c14057b395dca4456c479b","id":"pg_70f4e979f20d58009f63818de3767e24","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/aider-ai-aider-history-md-5dc9490bb35f-818de3767e24.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_32ea4d56ab1a52db8960f0035c9b095f"],"title":"Aider-AI/aider/HISTORY.md @ 5dc9490bb35f","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9774c2cd67c14057b395dca4456c479b"}
